  "abstract_summary": "These work presents a practical camera\u2013LiDAR fusion system for monitoring road traffic. The proposed pipeline combines 2D detections from panoramic images with 3D point clouds to achieve more reliable vehicle extraction. The system includes panorama generation from E57 data, YOLO\u2011based detection, point\u2011cloud downsam...",
